8	 * A package is "covered" when the pending changesets will bump it (directly). Dependents are NOT
9	 * required here — changesets bumps them automatically (`updateInternalDependencies`). Changes confined
10	 * to non-shipped files (tests, config, markdown) don't require a changeset.
